  "description": "Ma Do-Ae was born with a curse that plunges the other person into misfortune the moment she loves or is loved. There is only one way to break this curse: finding a \"fated partner\" who is immune to it. But of all people, the only candidate turns out to be the delinquent Gong Seon-Hwa? Forced into a relationship with the worst kind of man just to end the curse, will Do-Ae finally be able to find the \"real deal\" this time?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=849913), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14052414)",
